Package: CellCharterR
Title: Disk-Backed R Implementation of CellCharter Spatial Domains
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Christian", family = "Peralta Viteri", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "christian_94_97@hotmail.com"))
Description: Implements a reproducible, disk-backed workflow for identifying
    spatial domains in SpatialExperiment and SingleCellExperiment data. It
    constructs sample-local
    spatial graphs, aggregates exclusive graph-hop representations, fits
    batched full-covariance Gaussian mixture models with R Torch or an
    experimental multithreaded C++ CPU backend, and selects
    domain counts using CellCharter-style stability. It also provides
    cell-type enrichment, directed neighborhood enrichment, differential
    neighborhood enrichment, durable checkpoints, and a version-pinned CODEX
    mouse-spleen reproduction. This independently developed package is not
    affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by the original CellCharter
    authors or the Computational Systems Oncology group.
